BrainSTEM demo project data

The following files hold BrainSTEM's demo project (dataset brainstem_rich_demo_v1), exported from a
development server with tools/update_fixtures.sh, with user names replaced:

  tests/fixtures/demo_lab.json
  tests/fixtures/demo_export.json.gz

