Exceptions:

- Shared catalog entries in these files that come from third parties (for example brain atlases,
  anatomical regions, species and strains, and product names) remain under their sources' terms. Atlas
  records name their source, citation and license.
- The BrainSTEM data model, its JSON Schemas and its agent reference are not covered by this license and
